Tammy Si and Oscar Gomez
To build client:
go build client.go

To build server:
go build server.go

Then in one terminal run ./server

In another terminal run ./client <id>
In demo use id 1-8, one for each terminal

Then to run the demo for dynamo use go run client.go demo

// Sample demo run
Tammys-MacBook-Air:dynamo tammysi$ go run client.go demo
=== Initial placement (after inserts) ===
Maria -> Node6
John -> Node8
Anna -> Node6
Tim -> Node4
Alex -> Node4
Tammys-MacBook-Air:dynamo tammysi$ go run client.go get Maria
Value: 100
Tammys-MacBook-Air:dynamo tammysi$ go run client.go owner Maria
Key: Maria is on Node6
Tammys-MacBook-Air:dynamo tammysi$ go run client.go put Maria 150
Put successful
Tammys-MacBook-Air:dynamo tammysi$ go run client.go get Maria
Value: 150
Tammys-MacBook-Air:dynamo tammysi$ go run client.go owner Maria
Key: Maria is on Node6
Tammys-MacBook-Air:dynamo tammysi$ go run client.go get Maria
Value: 150
Tammys-MacBook-Air:dynamo tammysi$ go run client.go owner Maria
Key: Maria is on Node8
Tammys-MacBook-Air:dynamo tammysi$ go run client.go get Maria
Value: 150
Tammys-MacBook-Air:dynamo tammysi$ go run client.go put Maria 200
Put successful
Tammys-MacBook-Air:dynamo tammysi$ go run client.go owner Maria
Key: Maria is on Node8
Tammys-MacBook-Air:dynamo tammysi$ go run client.go get Maria
Value: 200

